emal organization of respiratory motile cilia, abnormal sweat electrolytes, decreased fertility, heterotaxy\n\nRelated to Primary Ciliary Dyskinesia Spectrum: ciliary discoordination due to random ciliary orientation, ciliary dyskinesia with defective radial spokes, ciliary dyskinesia with excessively long cilia\n\nRelated to Cystic Fibrosis Spectrum: autosomal recessive disease, respiratory system disease\n\n[Indirect reasoning chains (PrimeKG 2-hop):]\n  A 10-year-old girl is admitted to the medical floor for a respiratory infection → recurrent respiratory infections → Primary Ciliary Dyskinesia Spectrum\n  A 10-year-old girl is admitted to the medical floor for a respiratory infection → recurrent sinopulmonary infections → Primary Ciliary Dyskinesia Spectrum\n  A 10-year-old girl is admitted to the medical floor for a respiratory infection → recurrent lower respiratory tract infections → Primary Ciliary Dyskinesia Spectrum"}
